<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 101 mln rand S.African bonds Thurs.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 101 mln rand S.African bonds Thurs.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners sold a net 100.91 million rand's worth of South African bonds on Thursday after selling 317.59 million on Wednesday. Friday was a public holiday.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
